    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Questor Forgepact",
    "summary": "This rule has 3 parts:\n\n- **Mechanicus Allies**: your army may include **TECH-PRIEST DOMINUS**, **TECH-PRIEST MANIPULUS**, **MARSHAL**, **RANGERS** and **VANGUARD** units, up to 500 points combined.\n- **Assisted Targeting (Aura)**, on your **IMPERIAL KNIGHTS** models: ranged attacks by any **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS** unit of yours within 6\" of such a model get +1 **BS** and **[[HEAVY]](vsdata:weapon-ability/heavy)**.\n- **Sacristan Pledge**, on your **TECH-PRIEST** models: in your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), each may pick 1 **IMPERIAL KNIGHTS** model of yours, within 3\" of it, that this ability hasn't picked yet this phase; the chosen model **heals** D3 wounds.",
